{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re going full circle. CIRCLE EMPIRES is back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer a world of interconnected circles, with vicious foes to conquer and precious loot to plunder, in <strong>CIRCLE EMPIRES 2</strong>. Strengthen your armies, conquer enemy bosses, and adapt to ever-changing circular worlds that make each playthrough feel unique.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With all-new units, weapons, and game modes, you can team up with friends or compete alone for glory. Whether you're a newcomer or a seasoned circular strategist, the battle for disc-shaped dominance never stops. <br> <br><strong>AROUND THE WORLD</strong> The empires in <strong>CIRCLE EMPIRES 2</strong> are made up of... circles! Each one is a tiny ecosystem, teeming with resources, wildlife, and enemies. Conquer them for the win, but beware: each circle holds new dangers, from vicious villains to brutal bosses.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093020/extras/2bfb6052aff7d552b8402af4881b245b.poster.avif?t=1772794112\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093020/extras/2bfb6052aff7d552b8402af4881b245b.webm?t=1772794112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093020/extras/2bfb6052aff7d552b8402af4881b245b.mp4?t=1772794112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNITS GALORE</strong> Command armies of diverse units, each with unique skills and abilities. From fierce warriors and sneaky archers to powerful mages riding mighty beasts, the right mix of troops is the key to victory. And you can experiment with your own loadouts with<strong> our new unit designer!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NO TWO GAMES ARE THE SAME</strong> Every playthrough brings new maps and worlds to explore, filled with new circles &amp; new challenges. Whether you prefer planning out your grand strategy or diving headfirst into chaos, <strong>CIRCLE EMPIRES 2</strong> offers a range of difficulty settings to suit your style. Need a bit of routine? Play our Daily Challenges and climb up the leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093020/extras/cf9df8c9b81c33b35681d593ae5e2564.poster.avif?t=1772794112\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093020/extras/cf9df8c9b81c33b35681d593ae5e2564.webm?t=1772794112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093020/extras/cf9df8c9b81c33b35681d593ae5e2564.mp4?t=1772794112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY WITH YOUR FRIENDS</strong> Conquest is always more fun if you\u2019re doing it with (or against) your pals. In multiplayer mode, you can team up with allies to conquer the world together or compete against each other to see who can build the strongest empire. Multiplayer takes the action to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093020/extras/2656c4fb9e9572d3c327962d9a3e1258.poster.avif?t=1772794112\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093020/extras/2656c4fb9e9572d3c327962d9a3e1258.webm?t=1772794112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093020/extras/2656c4fb9e9572d3c327962d9a3e1258.mp4?t=1772794112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced RTS Gameplay:</strong> Build, expand, and battle kingdom after kingdom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability:</strong> Randomly generated worlds with unique flora, fauna, and enemies keep every game fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Units and Upgrades:</strong> From archers to necromancers, every unit can level up, gain experience, and ride larger creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mounting system:</strong> Combine units creatively. Mount smaller units on larger creatures for unique advantages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improved AI and Tactics:</strong> Enemies use smarter strategies, forcing you to adapt and rethink your approach.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Modes:</strong> Play cooperatively or competitively with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Biomes:</strong> Explore a range of environments to conquer and use them to your advantage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Customisation:</strong> Adjust settings, tweak difficulties, and tailor your game to your liking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exciting New Features:</strong> Experience new units, buildings, terrain effects, and upgrades that add depth and strategy to the world of Circle Empires.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"It works","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3093020/5e8774b8d0cd7843b32f77938b3a65a70eebfdfc.jpg"},{"name":"A beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3093020/2c4331bb575b62eb10dd96b630a4478cbf7f1819.jpg"},{"name":"Easy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3093020/a1f13a9