20/extras/2bfb6052aff7d552b8402af4881b245b.mp4?t=1772794112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNITS GALORE</strong> Command armies of diverse units, each with unique skills and abilities. From fierce warriors and sneaky archers to powerful mages riding mighty beasts, the right mix of troops is the key to victory. And you can experiment with your own loadouts with<strong> our new unit designer!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NO TWO GAMES ARE THE SAME</strong> Every playthrough brings new maps and worlds to explore, filled with new circles &amp; new challenges. Whether you prefer planning out your grand strategy or diving headfirst into chaos, <strong>CIRCLE EMPIRES 2</strong> offers a range of difficulty settings to suit your style. Need a bit of routine? Play our Daily Challenges and climb up the leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093020/extras/cf9df8c9b81c33b35681d593ae5e2564.poster.avif?t=1772794112\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093020/extras/cf9df8c9b81c33b35681d593ae5e2564.webm?t=1772794112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093020/extras/cf9df8c9b81c33b35681d593ae5e2564.mp4?t=1772794112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY WITH YOUR FRIENDS</strong> Conquest is always more fun if you\u2019re doing it with (or against) your pals. In multiplayer mode, you can team up with allies to conquer the world together or compete against each other to see who can build the strongest empire. Multiplayer takes the action to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay