hat add depth and strategy to the world of Circle Empires.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Luminous"],"dlc":[4308340],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093020/ac5870871aec61e0b7098074dda0d3d8b0e9fac8/header.jpg?t=1772794112","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Circle Empires 2 \u00a9 2026 Luminous. Developed by Luminous. Licensed exclusively to and published by Iceberg Interactive B.V. Iceberg Interactive design and mark are registered trademarks of Iceberg Interactive B.V. Microsoft\u00ae, Windows\u00ae and DirectX\u00ae are registered trademarks of Microsoft Corporation. All other brands, product names, and logos are trademarks or registered trademarks of their respective owners. All rights reserved. Made in Europe.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3093020/543228679/71d875f398ab060895b4384dade7fd71c3254985/1770631779/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770642039","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3093020/543228679/71d875f398ab060895b4384dade7fd71c3254985/1770631779/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770642039","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3093020/543228679/71d875f398ab060895b4384dade7fd71c3254985/1770631779/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770642039","id":257282673,"name":"Circle Empires 2 - Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257282673/7a80c0ffbe636a1995515ef01fbb02bf25843b37/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1770642039"}],"name":"Circle Empires 2","package_groups